 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted at the top of the list (9): Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber ('AC'), Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Start Your Engines!, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Boonta Eve Podrace, Sebulba's Podracer and Power Of The Hutt (the free Effect Start Your Engines! deploys); these count toward the 60.",
  "Format Premiere - Coruscant: the list plays Coruscant cards (Yade M'rak, Televan Koreyy, Gardulla The Hutt, Naboo Blaster Rifle, Neimoidian Advisor, Masterful Move & Endor Occupation).",
  "Posted 'AC' dested Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark), the site Court Of The Vile Gangster starts; 'T. Cantina', 'T.Docking Bay 94', 'T. Lars Moisture Farm', 'Podrace Arena' and 'Boonta Eve Podrace' dested the Dark pages; 'T. Judland Wastes' dested Tatooine: Jundland Wastes; 'Great Pit of Carcoon' dested Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon.",
  "Posted 'Cloud City Docking Bay' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay), the Dark Cloud City docking bay (Platform 327 is the Light one).",
  "Posted 'Naboo Blaster Rifle' dested the Dark Coruscant weapon Naboo Blaster Rifle (Dark), which the strategy puts on Jodo Kast ('Jodo Cast').",
  "Posted 'Arcia' dested Arica; 'Boleo' Boelo; 'Gardula the Hutt' Gardulla The Hutt; 'Nemodian Advisor' Neimoidian Advisor; 'Elis Herlot' Elis Helrot; 'Bossk in Hound Tooth' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Boba Fett' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City) per earlier DeckTech rulings.",
  "Search And Destroy is posted under Interrupts but is an Effect; Secret Plans (posted under Effects, before Reflections III shields existed) is the Special Edition Effect.",
  "The strategy claims a 24-8 record in tournament play, with no event named."
 ],
